  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A thin old Heavenly Court Gu Immortal greets Nian Er Nong Fu as friend Nian Er. He says he cultivates wood path, is skilled in growing resources, and that when he was still young, friend Nian Er was one of his goals.",
      "chapters": [
        1719
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a thin old man.",
      "chapters": [
        1719
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance-and-renown",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration lists him among Zhu Que Er, Vortex Space Boy, Wu Shuang, Yu Zhu Zi, and others as famous Heavenly Court experts in history when Central Continent immortals charge Eastern Sea together.",
      "chapters": [
        1924
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance-and-renown",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhu_que_er",
        "char_vortex_space_boy",
        "char_yu_zhu_zi",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While Wan Zi Hong maintains petal killer moves against Red River Wheel, Yu Zhu Zi and Ye Qiao Zi appear around her. He emits a mass of yellow light, sometimes slow, sometimes fast, that traps ancient desolate beasts so they hover unable to move.",
      "chapters": [
        1925
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fighting-beside-wan-zi-hong",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wan_zi_hong",
        "house_red_river_wheel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His killer moves create wooden stakes in a circle to trap Calamity Luck Altar, then bright green vines grow from the stakes and wrap the house, spreading upward toward the phantom River of Time. Cooperating with Duke Long to restrain the rank eight Immortal Gu House, he suffers killer move backlash, coughs blood, takes heavy injuries, and retreats into the qi wall.",
      "chapters": [
        1927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fighting-beside-wan-zi-hong",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "char_duke_long",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Vortex Space Boy he stops Wu Yong and Yi Hao Fang from interrupting Zhao Shan He’s killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        1931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fighting-beside-wan-zi-hong",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong",
        "char_yi_hao_fang",
        "char_zhao_shan_he"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zhu Que Er and Ye Qiao Zi join forces to attack Wu Yong, who sighs and retreats.",
      "chapters": [
        1932
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fighting-beside-wan-zi-hong",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He activates long range killer moves. Vines grow out of thin air and spread toward Wu Yong to bind him, forcing Wu Yong back into Clear Jade Dripping Wind Tiny Bamboo Building with Prince Feng Xian and Zhou Xiong Xin also pressing.",
      "chapters": [
        1948
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "renewed-offensives",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_clear_jade_dripping_wind_tiny_bamboo_building",
        "char_prince_feng_xian",
        "char_zhou_xiong_xin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He attacks together with Vortex Space Boy as Heavenly Court drives the three regions’ Immortal Gu Houses into retreat.",
      "chapters": [
        1953
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "renewed-offensives",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He blocks Fang Yuan’s path. Fang Yuan’s punch pierces through his wooden armor and kills him.",
      "chapters": [
        1959
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-by-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    }
  ],
